DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270106
RRULE:FREQ=YEARLY
SUMMARY:論語 1.7 賢賢易色
DESCRIPTION:論語 1.7：子夏曰：賢賢易色，事父母能竭其力
 ，事君能致其身，與朋友交言而有信。雖曰未學，吾必
 謂之學矣。\nhttps://yikonglu.com/zh-hant/lunyu/xue-er/7.html
URL:https://yikonglu.com/zh-hant/lunyu/xue-er/7.html
