DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270614
RRULE:FREQ=YEARLY
SUMMARY:論語 9.27 歲寒
DESCRIPTION:論語 9.27：子曰：歲寒，然後知松柏之後彫也。\
 nhttps://yikonglu.com/zh-hant/lunyu/zi-han/27.html
URL:https://yikonglu.com/zh-hant/lunyu/zi-han/27.html
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
