UID:nianli-282-zh-Hant@yikonglu.com
DTSTAMP:20261115T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20271009
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20271010
RRULE:FREQ=YEARLY
SUMMARY:論語 15.10 顏淵問為邦
DESCRIPTION:論語 15.10：顏淵問為邦。子曰：行夏之時，乘殷
 之輅，服周之冕，樂則韶舞。放鄭聲，遠佞人。鄭聲淫
 ，佞人殆。\nhttps://yikonglu.com/zh-hant/lunyu/wei-ling-gong/10.html
URL:https://yikonglu.com/zh-hant/lunyu/wei-ling-gong/10.html
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
