UID:nianli-283-zh-Hant@yikonglu.com
DTSTAMP:20261115T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20271010
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20271011
RRULE:FREQ=YEARLY
SUMMARY:論語 15.11 人無遠慮
DESCRIPTION:論語 15.11：子曰：人無遠慮，必有近憂。\nhttps:/
 /yikonglu.com/zh-hant/lunyu/wei-ling-gong/11.html
URL:https://yikonglu.com/zh-hant/lunyu/wei-ling-gong/11.html
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
