DTSTAMP:20261115T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20271031
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20271101
RRULE:FREQ=YEARLY
SUMMARY:論語 16.4 益者三友
DESCRIPTION:論語 16.4：孔子曰：益者三友，損者三友。友直
 ，友諒，友多聞，益矣。友便辟，友善柔，友便佞，損
 矣。\nhttps://yikonglu.com/zh-hant/lunyu/ji-shi/4.html
URL:https://yikonglu.com/zh-hant/lunyu/ji-shi/4.html
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:nianli-305-zh-Hant@yikonglu.com
DTSTAMP:20261115T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20271101
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20271102
RRULE:FREQ=YEARLY
SUMMARY:論語 16.5 益者三樂
DESCRIPTION:論語 16.5：孔子曰：益者三樂，損者三樂。樂節
 禮樂，樂道人之善，樂多賢友，益矣。樂驕樂，樂佚遊
 ，樂宴樂，損矣。\nhttps://yikonglu.com/zh-hant/lunyu/ji-shi/5.html
URL:https://yikonglu.com/zh-hant/lunyu/ji-shi/5.html
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
