DTSTAMP:20261115T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20271102
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20271103
RRULE:FREQ=YEARLY
SUMMARY:論語 16.6 侍於君子有三愆
DESCRIPTION:論語 16.6：孔子曰：侍於君子有三愆：言未及之
 而言謂之躁，言及之而不言謂之隱，未見顏色而言謂之
 瞽。\nhttps://yikonglu.com/zh-hant/lunyu/ji-shi/6.html
URL:https://yikonglu.com/zh-hant/lunyu/ji-shi/6.html
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
