DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20271103
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20271104
RRULE:FREQ=YEARLY
SUMMARY:論語 16.7 君子有三戒
DESCRIPTION:論語 16.7：孔子曰：君子有三戒：少之時，血氣
 未定，戒之在色；及其壯也，血氣方剛，戒之在鬥；及
 其老也，血氣既衰，戒之在得。\nhttps://yikonglu.com/zh-hant/l
 unyu/ji-shi/7.html
URL:https://yikonglu.com/zh-hant/lunyu/ji-shi/7.html
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
